    <sys:String x:Key="Prov_PorQueNaoDa">Why can't I use the Teams/Word Copilot?</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Prov_OMicrosoft365Copilot">Microsoft 365 Copilot (the one in Teams, Word and Outlook) does not expose a public “send text, get answer” API for third-party apps — it runs inside the Microsoft apps. The supported way to use the AI your company already pays for is Azure OpenAI: with a key (Azure OpenAI option) or with the corporate sign-in (Microsoft 365 option), both enabled by IT. GitHub Copilot works with your GitHub token.</sys:String>
