    <sys:String x:Key="Ext_Subtitulo">Optional connectors. Tokens are encrypted (DPAPI) for this Windows user only, and every action that changes something outside this machine goes through the DecisionGate. Preview: tested against simulated servers, not yet against real accounts.</sys:String>
