    <sys:String x:Key="Cfg_McpNota">The extensions (Power BI, PowerPoint, Databricks, Git, e-mail, work items, Teams, Windows apps) become Claude Code and Codex tools in tasks — every call goes through the gate. When stopped, tasks start without it. The state is kept when NXPilot closes.</sys:String>
