    <sys:String x:Key="Win_Origem">Origin (area)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Win_OrigemTip">Text that identifies the area to watch, such as a title or header. Only what comes after the last line that is exactly this text counts. If it is not on screen, nothing fires. Leave empty to watch the whole window.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Win_AvisarPalavras">Alert when it shows</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Win_AvisarPalavrasTip">Comma-separated words. The alert fires only for a NEW line containing one of them (ignoring case and accents). Empty: alerts on every new line.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Win_AoDisparar">When it fires</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Win_AoDispararTip">Optional: runs an already approved process (at most once per read). Deletion steps ask for confirmation at that moment.</sys:String>
