    <sys:String x:Key="NewTask_PadraoAssunto">Subject default</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="NewTask_PadraoAssuntoDica">Saves the agent, Claude model, reviewer and Codex model chosen above as this subject's default. When you pick the subject in a new task, these options come back on their own (you can still change them). It applies only to this subject: the others keep the last choice.</sys:String>
