    <sys:String x:Key="NewTask_CitarArquivo">📎 Cite file…</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="NewTask_CitarPasta">📁 Cite folder…</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="NewTask_CitarArquivoDica">Drag files or folders into the Intent or Criteria, or use Cite file / Cite folder: only the path goes into the text — nothing is copied or attached. Inside the subject (or repository) the relative path is used, which the agent finds in its working copy; outside it, the full path (reading outside the folder goes through the gate).</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="NewTask_Citacoes">Citations</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="NewTask_TirarCitacao">Remove this citation (its markers leave the text and the next ones are renumbered)</sys:String>
    <!-- Extensão Teams -->
    <sys:String x:Key="Ext_TeamsUrl">Channel webhook URL (Workflows or Incoming Webhook)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Ext_TeamsComo">In Teams, on the channel: ⋯ → Workflows → "Post to a channel when a webhook request is received" (or the legacy Incoming Webhook) and copy the URL. It already contains the authorization: anyone with the URL can post to the channel — that is why it is encrypted for this Windows user only.</sys:String>
